{"id":"95a33888a8fb67bb","group":"72","path":"72/72-df-sigma-bounded-hierarchy.md","title":"Sigma-bounded Hierarchy","display":"df-sigma-bounded-hierarchy — Sigma-bounded Hierarchy","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Handbook of Proof Theory","book_abbrev":"72","label":"72-df-sigma-bounded-hierarchy","aliases":["72-df-sigma-bounded-hierarchy"],"display":"df-sigma-bounded-hierarchy — Sigma-bounded Hierarchy","depends_on":["[[72-df-bounded-arithmetic]]"],"source_author":"Samuel R. Buss","source_chapter":"Samuel R. Buss, Chapter II, Proof Theory of Arithmetic, in Handbook of Proof Theory (1998)","source_sections":"§1.3.3","source_printed_pages":"99–100","source_pdf_pages":"111–112","source_pdf":"C:\\Users\\lzy\\Documents\\BaiduSyncdisk\\calibre\\libgen.li\\[Studies in Logic and the Foundatio (2867)\\[Studies in Logic and the Found - libgen.li.pdf","verification_status":"definition-contract-checked","source_proof_status":"not-applicable-definition; local well-definedness and referenced interfaces checked","eligible_as_verified_dependency":true,"round2_verification_status":"definition-contract-checked"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Handbook of Proof Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"72"},{"key":"label","html":"72-df-sigma-bounded-hierarchy"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>72-df-sigma-bounded-hierarchy</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-sigma-bounded-hierarchy — Sigma-bounded Hierarchy"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"fb2b2dbad774692a\" href=\"?note=fb2b2dbad774692a\" title=\"72-df-bounded-arithmetic\">72-df-bounded-arithmetic</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_author","html":"Samuel R. Buss"},{"key":"source_chapter","html":"Samuel R. Buss, Chapter II, Proof Theory of Arithmetic, in Handbook of Proof Theory (1998)"},{"key":"source_sections","html":"§1.3.3"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"99–100"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"111–112"},{"key":"source_pdf","html":"C:\\Users\\lzy\\Documents\\BaiduSyncdisk\\calibre\\libgen.li[Studies in Logic and the Foundatio (2867)[Studies in Logic and the Found - libgen.li.pdf"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"definition-contract-checked"},{"key":"source_proof_status","html":"not-applicable-definition; local well-definedness and referenced interfaces checked"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"true"},{"key":"round2_verification_status","html":"definition-contract-checked"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal F=\\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{BA}})\">\\(\\mathcal F=\\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{BA}})\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{SharpBoundedFml}_{\\mathrm{BA}}\">\\(\\mathrm{SharpBoundedFml}_{\\mathrm{BA}}\\)</span> 及有界构造取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"fb2b2dbad774692a\" href=\"?note=fb2b2dbad774692a\" title=\"72-df-bounded-arithmetic\">72-df-bounded-arithmetic</a>。</li>\n<li>对 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"i\\in\\omega\\setminus\\{0\\}\">\\(i\\in\\omega\\setminus\\{0\\}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal K_i\\subseteq\\mathcal P(\\mathcal F)^2\">\\(\\mathcal K_i\\subseteq\\mathcal P(\\mathcal F)^2\\)</span> 在已定义 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma_{i-1}^b,\\Pi_{i-1}^b\">\\(\\Sigma_{i-1}^b,\\Pi_{i-1}^b\\)</span> 后由下式给出；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma_i^b,\\Pi_i^b\">\\(\\Sigma_i^b,\\Pi_i^b\\)</span> 作同时递归。</li>\n<li>量词构造中的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\\in\\mathrm{Var}_S\">\\(x\\in\\mathrm{Var}_S\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"t\\in\\mathrm{Trm}_S(\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{BA}})\">\\(t\\in\\mathrm{Trm}_S(\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{BA}})\\)</span> 始终满足 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\\notin\\operatorname{VarTerm}_{\\mathrm{BA}}(t)\">\\(x\\notin\\operatorname{VarTerm}_{\\mathrm{BA}}(t)\\)</span>。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma_0^b=\\Pi_0^b:=\\mathrm{SharpBoundedFml}_{\\mathrm{BA}}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\Sigma_0^b=\\Pi_0^b:=\\mathrm{SharpBoundedFml}_{\\mathrm{BA}}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathcal K_i:=\\{(U,W)\\in\\mathcal P(\\mathcal F)^2:\\;&amp;\n\\Pi_{i-1}^b\\subseteq U\\land\\Sigma_{i-1}^b\\subseteq W\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall A,B\\in U\\;((A\\land B)\\in U\\land(A\\lor B)\\in U)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall A,B\\in W\\;((A\\land B)\\in W\\land(A\\lor B)\\in W)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall A\\in W\\;\\forall B\\in U\\;(\\neg A\\in U\\land(A\\to B)\\in U)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall A\\in U\\;\\forall B\\in W\\;(\\neg A\\in W\\land(A\\to B)\\in W)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall A\\in U\\;\\forall x,t\\;\n\\bigl((x\\in\\mathrm{Var}_S\\land t\\in\\mathrm{Trm}_S(\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{BA}})\\land x\\notin\\operatorname{VarTerm}_{\\mathrm{BA}}(t))\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{32mm}\\to((\\forall x\\leq|t|)A\\in U\\land(\\exists x\\leq t)A\\in U)\\bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall A\\in W\\;\\forall x,t\\;\n\\bigl((x\\in\\mathrm{Var}_S\\land t\\in\\mathrm{Trm}_S(\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{BA}})\\land x\\notin\\operatorname{VarTerm}_{\\mathrm{BA}}(t))\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{32mm}\\to((\\exists x\\leq|t|)A\\in W\\land(\\forall x\\leq t)A\\in W)\\bigr)\\},\\\\\n\\Sigma_i^b&amp;:=\\bigcap\\{U\\subseteq\\mathcal F:\\exists W\\subseteq\\mathcal F\\;(U,W)\\in\\mathcal K_i\\},\\\\\n\\Pi_i^b&amp;:=\\bigcap\\{W\\subseteq\\mathcal F:\\exists U\\subseteq\\mathcal F\\;(U,W)\\in\\mathcal K_i\\}.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathcal K_i:=\\{(U,W)\\in\\mathcal P(\\mathcal F)^2:\\;&amp;\n\\Pi_{i-1}^b\\subseteq U\\land\\Sigma_{i-1}^b\\subseteq W\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall A,B\\in U\\;((A\\land B)\\in U\\land(A\\lor B)\\in U)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall A,B\\in W\\;((A\\land B)\\in W\\land(A\\lor B)\\in W)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall A\\in W\\;\\forall B\\in U\\;(\\neg A\\in U\\land(A\\to B)\\in U)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall A\\in U\\;\\forall B\\in W\\;(\\neg A\\in W\\land(A\\to B)\\in W)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall A\\in U\\;\\forall x,t\\;\n\\bigl((x\\in\\mathrm{Var}_S\\land t\\in\\mathrm{Trm}_S(\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{BA}})\\land x\\notin\\operatorname{VarTerm}_{\\mathrm{BA}}(t))\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{32mm}\\to((\\forall x\\leq|t|)A\\in U\\land(\\exists x\\leq t)A\\in U)\\bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall A\\in W\\;\\forall x,t\\;\n\\bigl((x\\in\\mathrm{Var}_S\\land t\\in\\mathrm{Trm}_S(\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{BA}})\\land x\\notin\\operatorname{VarTerm}_{\\mathrm{BA}}(t))\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{32mm}\\to((\\exists x\\leq|t|)A\\in W\\land(\\forall x\\leq t)A\\in W)\\bigr)\\},\\\\\n\\Sigma_i^b&amp;:=\\bigcap\\{U\\subseteq\\mathcal F:\\exists W\\subseteq\\mathcal F\\;(U,W)\\in\\mathcal K_i\\},\\\\\n\\Pi_i^b&amp;:=\\bigcap\\{W\\subseteq\\mathcal F:\\exists U\\subseteq\\mathcal F\\;(U,W)\\in\\mathcal K_i\\}.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Ch. II §1.3.3，印刷 pp. 99–100（PDF pp. 111–112），定义的 (a)–(d) 及其对偶已逐项核对。</li>\n<li>旧 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{BoolCl}\">\\(\\operatorname{BoolCl}\\)</span> 未定义，且若含任意否定闭包，会把正、负层混同。本修订按原书正负位置的同时最小闭包构造，保留同一层的有界存在闭包与锐有界全称闭包。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(\\mathcal F,\\mathcal F)\\in\\mathcal K_i\">\\((\\mathcal F,\\mathcal F)\\in\\mathcal K_i\\)</span>；所有闭包条件为有限前提 Horn 条件，逐分量交仍满足，故最小对存在。外层 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"i\">\\(i\\)</span> 递归沿 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\omega\">\\(\\omega\\)</span>，不依赖下游 Pi 原子，未引入依赖环。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"72-df-bounded-arithmetic","status":"resolved","id":"fb2b2dbad774692a","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-df-bounded-arithmetic]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-bounded-arithmetic","status":"resolved","id":"fb2b2dbad774692a","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathcal F=\\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{BA}})$，$\\mathrm{SharpBoundedFml}_{\\mathrm{BA}}$ 及有界构造取 [[72-df-bounded-arithmetic]]。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathcal F=\\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{BA}})","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{SharpBoundedFml}_{\\mathrm{BA}}","display":false},{"tex":"i\\in\\omega\\setminus\\{0\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal K_i\\subseteq\\mathcal P(\\mathcal F)^2","display":false},{"tex":"\\Sigma_{i-1}^b,\\Pi_{i-1}^b","display":false},{"tex":"\\Sigma_i^b,\\Pi_i^b","display":false},{"tex":"x\\in\\mathrm{Var}_S","display":false},{"tex":"t\\in\\mathrm{Trm}_S(\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{BA}})","display":false},{"tex":"x\\notin\\operatorname{VarTerm}_{\\mathrm{BA}}(t)","display":false},{"tex":"\\Sigma_0^b=\\Pi_0^b:=\\mathrm{SharpBoundedFml}_{\\mathrm{BA}}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathcal K_i:=\\{(U,W)\\in\\mathcal P(\\mathcal F)^2:\\;&\n\\Pi_{i-1}^b\\subseteq U\\land\\Sigma_{i-1}^b\\subseteq W\\\\\n&\\land\\forall A,B\\in U\\;((A\\land B)\\in U\\land(A\\lor B)\\in U)\\\\\n&\\land\\forall A,B\\in W\\;((A\\land B)\\in W\\land(A\\lor B)\\in W)\\\\\n&\\land\\forall A\\in W\\;\\forall B\\in U\\;(\\neg A\\in U\\land(A\\to B)\\in U)\\\\\n&\\land\\forall A\\in U\\;\\forall B\\in W\\;(\\neg A\\in W\\land(A\\to B)\\in W)\\\\\n&\\land\\forall A\\in U\\;\\forall x,t\\;\n\\bigl((x\\in\\mathrm{Var}_S\\land t\\in\\mathrm{Trm}_S(\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{BA}})\\land x\\notin\\operatorname{VarTerm}_{\\mathrm{BA}}(t))\\\\\n&\\hspace{32mm}\\to((\\forall x\\leq|t|)A\\in U\\land(\\exists x\\leq t)A\\in U)\\bigr)\\\\\n&\\land\\forall A\\in W\\;\\forall x,t\\;\n\\bigl((x\\in\\mathrm{Var}_S\\land t\\in\\mathrm{Trm}_S(\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{BA}})\\land x\\notin\\operatorname{VarTerm}_{\\mathrm{BA}}(t))\\\\\n&\\hspace{32mm}\\to((\\exists x\\leq|t|)A\\in W\\land(\\forall x\\leq t)A\\in W)\\bigr)\\},\\\\\n\\Sigma_i^b&:=\\bigcap\\{U\\subseteq\\mathcal F:\\exists W\\subseteq\\mathcal F\\;(U,W)\\in\\mathcal K_i\\},\\\\\n\\Pi_i^b&:=\\bigcap\\{W\\subseteq\\mathcal F:\\exists U\\subseteq\\mathcal F\\;(U,W)\\in\\mathcal K_i\\}.\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{BoolCl}","display":false},{"tex":"(\\mathcal F,\\mathcal F)\\in\\mathcal K_i","display":false},{"tex":"i","display":false},{"tex":"\\omega","display":false}],"bytes":3251,"backlinks":[{"id":"00439897fba390aa","anchor":"ref-187","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[72-df-sigma-bounded-hierarchy|df-sigma-bounded-hierarchy — Sigma-bounded Hierarchy]]"},{"id":"b1b2bc1f3d190ee9","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$i\\in\\omega$；$\\mathcal F=\\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{BA}})$ 及 $\\Sigma_i^b,\\Pi_i^b$ 取 [[72-df-sigma-bounded-hierarchy]]、[[72-df-pi-bounded-hierarchy]]。"},{"id":"70ff58eeae2491db","anchor":"ref-185","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[df-sigma-bounded-hierarchy — Sigma-bounded Hierarchy](72-df-sigma-bounded-hierarchy.md)"},{"id":"b7eb80d584ed5255","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$i\\in\\omega$；$\\mathcal F$、$\\mathcal K_i$ 及同时递归对 $(\\Sigma_i^b,\\Pi_i^b)$ 取 [[72-df-sigma-bounded-hierarchy]]。"},{"id":"690ac0b5f3b63c49","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$i\\in\\omega$；$\\mathrm{BASIC}$ 取 [[72-df-basic-axioms]]，$\\Sigma_i^b$ 取 [[72-df-sigma-bounded-hierarchy]]。"},{"id":"633c2d970d6483e6","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$i\\geq1$，$k\\in\\omega$，$T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}(\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{BA}})$；$\\Sigma_i^b$ 取 [[72-df-sigma-bounded-hierarchy]]。"},{"id":"bde0adecda9b3967","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$i\\in\\omega$；$\\mathrm{BASIC}$ 取 [[72-df-basic-axioms]]，$\\Sigma_i^b$ 取 [[72-df-sigma-bounded-hierarchy]]。"},{"id":"4d85a6a31705a214","anchor":"ref-201","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[./72-df-sigma-bounded-hierarchy|df-sigma-bounded-hierarchy — Sigma-bounded Hierarchy]]"},{"id":"a04488efdf405cc2","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$i\\geq1$；对所有 $j\\in\\omega$ 固定 $x_j=v_j$。对每个 $k\\in\\omega$，$\\vec x=(x_0,\\ldots,x_{k-1})$；$\\Sigma_i^b,\\Pi_i^b$ 取 [[72-df-sigma-bounded-hierarchy]]、[[72-df-pi-bounded-hierarchy]]。"},{"id":"29de2a641cbd0b98","anchor":"ref-291","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../72-df-sigma-bounded-hierarchy]]"}],"outgoing":["fb2b2dbad774692a"]}